e for the future I propose to myself?","w":"简·爱"},"q":{"t":"Somewhere a storm was gathering, but only a small cloud had scattered some raindrops lightly, sprinkling the road and the sappy leaves.","w":"战争与和平","a":"Leo Tolstoy"},"b":{"r":"Hebrews 11:28","c":"希伯来书 11:28","t":"Through faith he kept the passover, and the sprinkling of blood, lest he that destroyed the firstborn should touch them."},"b2":{"r":"Leviticus 7:14","c":"利未记 7:14","t":"Of it he shall offer one out of each offering for a heave offering to the LORD. It shall be the priest’s who sprinkles the blood of the peace offerings."}},{"w":"squash","uk":"/skwɒʃ/","us":"/skwɑʃ/","p":"v.","m":"压扁 n.璧球","f":["squashing"],"c":[],"o":null,"q":{"t":"Once more, the Dover mail struggled on, with the jack-boots of its passengers squashing along by its side.","w":"双城记","a":"Charles Dickens"},"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"subgroup","uk":"/ˈsʌbɡruːp/","us":"/ˈsʌbɡruːp/","p":"n.","m":"子群","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"submerge","uk":"/səbˈmɜːdʒ/","us":"/səbˈmɜrdʒ/","p":"v.","m":"(使)浸没；掩盖","f":[],"c":["deeply submerged"],"o":null,"q":{"t":"As the boats now more closely surrounded him, the whole upper part of his form, with much of it that is ordinarily submerged, was plainly revealed.","w":"白鲸","a":"Herman Melville"},"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"substract","uk":"","us":"","p":"v.","m":"减去；减","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"subway","uk":"/ˈsʌbweɪ/","us":"/ˈsʌbweɪ/","p":"n.","m":"［英］地下通道；［美］地铁","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"suffix","uk":"/ˈsʌfɪks/","us":"/ˈsʌfɪks/","p":"n.","m":"后缀，词尾；尾标","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"suitcase","uk":"/ˈsuːtkeɪs/","us":"/ˈsuːtkeɪs/","p":"n.","m":"手提箱","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"supermarket","uk":"/ˈsuːpəmɑːkɪt/","us":"/ˈsuːpəmɑkɪt/","p":"n.","m":"超市","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"syllabus","uk":"/ˈsɪləbəs/","us":"/ˈsɪləbəs/","p":"n